WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.068
Market sizing, done step by step.

2
00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:06.850
How many cups of coffee do London cafés sell on a weekday?

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.189
Clarify: cups, one weekday, London

4
00:00:11.289 --> 00:00:14.619
9M people in London

5
00:00:14.719 --> 00:00:17.904
25% buy from a café on a weekday

6
00:00:18.004 --> 00:00:20.314
1.5 cups each

7
00:00:20.414 --> 00:00:26.090
9M × 25% × 1.5 ≈ 3.4M cups

8
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:35.414
Then sanity-check it: with about four thousand cafés, that is roughly eight hundred cups each a day. A little high, so you might trim the share.
